## Runtime rules

- Treat this file as local identity only; it does not prove current runtime health.
- Verify live state before claiming services, routes, jobs, sessions, or sync surfaces are healthy.
- Do not assume service names. Discover launchd/systemd units, processes, ports, and logs live.
- Keep secrets out of this file.

## Fleet routing notes

- Control-plane decisions should be reviewed on Hermes00.
- Risky rollout should validate canary first, then stable worker, then control-plane propagation.
- If this host is a relay or unclassified worker, use only its documented role until fleet docs are updated.
